  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mekong Australia Partnership Phase 1 - Vietnam Economic Resilience Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mekong Australia Partnership (MAP) Economic Resilience pillar funded activities in Vietnam are supporting Vietnam&#x2019;s ambition to become a high-income country by 2045 by building relationships between Australian economic agencies and their Vietnamese counterparts, and, in partnership with UN Women, enhancing women&#x2019;s economic access and leadership.</narrative>
  </description>
